===Noun===
{{en-noun|changes of heart}}

# {{lb|en|idiomatic}} A change of one's [[opinion]], [[belief]] or [[decision]].
#: {{ux|en|He quit work on Friday, but on Monday he had a '''change of heart''' and decided to come back.}}
#* {{quote-song|en|title={{w|Rikki Don't Lose That Number}}|artist={{w|Steely Dan}}|year=1974|passage=We can go out driving on Slow Hand Row / We could stay inside and play games, I don't know / And you could have a '''change of heart'''}}
