|en
|year=2008
|last=Karpyshyn
|first=Drew
|authorlink=Drew Karpyshyn
|chapter=Epilogue
|title={{w|Mass Effect: Ascension}}
|url=https://archive.org/details/masseffectascens00karp_0/
|publisher={{w|Del Rey Books}}
|ISBN=978-0-345-49852-6
|OCLC=1128929913
|page=341
|pageurl=https://archive.org/details/masseffectascens00karp_0/page/341/
|text="I thought you were loyal to the cause, Paul."<br>“I was,” Grayson answered. “Then I saw the kind of people who share your vision, and I had a '''change of heart'''.”}}
